                  Parameters for Dual3D
                  *******************

START OF PARAMETERS:
../data/cluster.dat              -file with data
1   2   0    3                  -   columns for X, Y, Z, var
-1.0e21   1.0e21                 -   trimming limits
0                                -option: 0=grid, 1=jackknife
parta.dat                          -file with jackknife data
1   2   0    3                  -   columns for X,Y,Z,vr 
0                                -debugging level: 0,1,2,3
dual.dbg                         -file for debugging output
dual.out                         -file for kriged output
16   20.5   1.0                  -nx,xmn,xsiz
15    35.5     1.0                  -ny,ymn,ysiz
1    0.5    1.0                  -nz,zmn,zsiz
1    3.38                         -0=SK,1=OK
1    14                           -nst, nugget effect
1    13  0.0   0.0   0.0          -it,cc,ang1,ang2,ang3
         30.0  30.0  30.0          -a_hmax, a_hmin, a_vert
